WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,360
Your cooperation is to cut open my door first

2
00:00:02,360 --> 00:00:03,440
Hit the person who hurt me again

3
00:00:03,680 --> 00:00:05,320
He attacked the scout members first

4
00:00:05,560 --> 00:00:06,680
We are just rescuing people

5
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:14,050
Not human, etc.

6
00:00:14,250 --> 00:00:16,250
He helped me kill plainclothes men in Ziyuwan

7
00:00:16,490 --> 00:00:17,850
He also took the initiative to leave supplies

8
00:00:18,130 --> 00:00:19,170
If you really want to kill someone

9
00:00:19,170 --> 00:00:20,530
I couldn't go back then

10
00:00:20,810 --> 00:00:24,130
I will admit my mistake

11
00:00:24,130 --> 00:00:25,330
Everyone is getting ready to evacuate

12
00:00:26,940 --> 00:00:28,140
I only let you do this last time

13
00:00:28,140 --> 00:00:29,620
I knelt down for a while and didn’t kill you.

14
00:00:29,780 --> 00:00:31,300
But you took Su Wanwan away

15
00:00:31,790 --> 00:00:32,910
she is my enemy

16
00:00:32,910 --> 00:00:34,870
I was just on a rescue mission

17
00:00:34,870 --> 00:00:38,430
So I'm just asking you where she is. This is a misunderstanding.

18
00:00:39,410 --> 00:00:40,570
we can leave immediately

19
00:00:40,930 --> 00:00:44,180
I will also re-submit the cooperation method and let her go first.
